WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.667
-Guys, as I said earlier
everyone is talking about this

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:05.033
new COVID variant Omicron.

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:06.868
We don't know much about it yet,
so I thought it would be helpful

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:08.901
to break down
what's real and what's not.

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:11.234
It's time for "Fact Versus
Fiction," here we go.

00:00:11.234 --> 00:00:12.801
-♪ Fact ♪

00:00:12.801 --> 00:00:16.734
♪ Fact versus fiction ♪

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:17.968
-Let's get started.

00:00:17.968 --> 00:00:21.467
First up, fact,
the variant is called Omicron.

00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:23.467
Fiction,
Omicron is also the name

00:00:23.467 --> 00:00:25.167
of a villain in the new
Spider-Man movie.

00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:27.701
[ Applause ]
That's fake, that's not true.

00:00:27.701 --> 00:00:30.033
-Not true.
-Here's another one.

00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:33.434
Fact, New York City has issued
a health advisory.

00:00:33.434 --> 00:00:35.634
Fiction, because they saw
someone actually eating

00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:37.167
from a "Nuts 4 Nuts" cart.

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:38.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:43.200
-Wait.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.734
-Next -- that's not true.

00:00:44.734 --> 00:00:45.968
-That's not true,
that's fiction.

00:00:45.968 --> 00:00:50.100
-Next, fact, Biden says
there's no need to panic.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.267
Fiction, but he said you are
allowed to freak out about

00:00:52.267 --> 00:00:54.834
Netflix dropping the entire new
season of "Selling Sunset."

00:00:54.834 --> 00:01:00.434
[ Cheers and applause ]
I mean, the whole --

00:01:00.434 --> 00:01:01.634
after that, we have fact.

00:01:01.634 --> 00:01:05.334
The variant is
also known as B.1.1.529.

00:01:05.334 --> 00:01:07.934
Fiction, not to be confused with
your parent's wi-fi password,

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:11.868
which is 1234567!

00:01:11.868 --> 00:01:13.133
Don't forget
the exclamation point,

00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:15.534
that's what makes it different.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.534 --> 00:01:18.167
-No one will ever guess.
-No one, yeah.

00:01:18.167 --> 00:01:21.334
Finally, fact, Omicron is most
likely already in the U.S.,

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:23.000
but hasn't been detected yet.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.534
Fiction, people think it's the
skunk on "The Masked Singer."

00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:28.968
Wow, that's all the time we have
for "Fact Versus Fiction."

